@ name header code labels -> 131x64 GROB without the countdown (see TICK)
@ Layout must match tools/hpgrob.py (digits at x=11+17k (+6 after the 3rd), y=14).
\<< \-> name hdr code lbls
  \<<
    #131d #64d BLANK
    { #0d #0d } name 2 \->GROB REPL
    hdr 2 \->GROB DUP SIZE DROP #131d SWAP - #0d 2 \->LIST SWAP REPL
    1 6 FOR k
      k 1 - 17 * 11 + k 3 > 6 * + R\->B #14d 2 \->LIST
      DIGS code k k SUB NUM 47 - GET
      REPL
    NEXT
    { #0d #56d } lbls REPL
  \>>
\>>
